{
  "uid": "storage-retention",
  "title": "Storage & retention",
  "description": "Disk usage, fill forecast and the ingestion rate of every monitoring signal, with the retention caps in one place.",
  "tags": [
    "wolk-jjba",
    "storage",
    "retention",
    "capacity"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "mount",
        "label": "Filesystem",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(node_filesystem_avail_bytes{fstype!~\"tmpfs|devtmpfs|squashfs|overlay\"}, mountpoint)",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "/",
          "value": "/"
        },
        "options": [],
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Disk used",
      "description": "Percentage of the selected filesystem that is in use. This is the number to watch: Loki, Tempo, Prometheus, Grafana and the log files all live on it.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "100 * (1 - node_filesystem_avail_bytes{mountpoint=\"$mount\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|devtmpfs|squashfs|overlay\"} / node_filesystem_size_bytes{mountpoint=\"$mount\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|devtmpfs|squashfs|overlay\"})",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 1,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 75
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 90
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Free space",
      "description": "Bytes still available on the selected filesystem.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "node_filesystem_avail_bytes{mountpoint=\"$mount\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|devtmpfs|squashfs|overlay\"}",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "decimals": 1,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 80
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Days until full",
      "description": "Projection from the free-space trend of the last six hours. Values above a year mean the filesystem is stable; anything in the tens of days is worth acting on. Computed as free bytes divided by the current fill rate.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "clamp_max(node_filesystem_avail_bytes{mountpoint=\"$mount\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|devtmpfs|squashfs|overlay\"} / clamp_min(-deriv(node_filesystem_avail_bytes{mountpoint=\"$mount\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|devtmpfs|squashfs|overlay\"}[6h]), 1), 3650)",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "d",
          "decimals": 1,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 30
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 90
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Prometheus TSDB",
      "description": "Bytes of persisted Prometheus blocks. Capped at 3 GB by storage.tsdb.retention.size.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "prometheus_tsdb_storage_blocks_bytes",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "decimals": 1,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 2000000000
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 3000000000
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Filesystem use over time",
      "description": "Free and used bytes for the selected mountpoint.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "node_filesystem_avail_bytes{mountpoint=\"$mount\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|devtmpfs|squashfs|overlay\"}",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "free"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "node_filesystem_size_bytes{mountpoint=\"$mount\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|devtmpfs|squashfs|overlay\"} - node_filesystem_avail_bytes{mountpoint=\"$mount\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|devtmpfs|squashfs|overlay\"}",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "used"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Fill forecast (7 days)",
      "description": "Linear projection of free space. The dashed line crossing zero is when the disk fills; if the two lines are parallel the host is stable.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "node_filesystem_avail_bytes{mountpoint=\"$mount\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|devtmpfs|squashfs|overlay\"}",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "free now"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "predict_linear(node_filesystem_avail_bytes{mountpoint=\"$mount\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|devtmpfs|squashfs|overlay\"}[6h], 7 * 86400)",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "free in 7d"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Log lines per service (per hour)",
      "description": "Which daemon or file is chatty. This is the series that drives Loki disk use, so a sudden outlier here is what fills the disk.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "topk(12, sum by (service) (count_over_time({job=\"host\"} [1h])))",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Bytes ingested into Loki",
      "description": "Ingestion rate and compactor deletion rate. Over a day the ingested total is the daily footprint, and retention decides how many of those days stay on disk.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 13
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(loki_distributor_bytes_received_total[5m]))",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "ingested"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(loki_compactor_deleted_chunks_total[5m]))",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "deleted chunks/s"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "Bps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Bytes of traces received",
      "description": "Trace ingestion. Spans are the bulkiest signal per useful minute, which is why Tempo keeps three days while Loki keeps fourteen and Prometheus thirty.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(tempo_distributor_bytes_received_total[5m]))",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "traces"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "Bps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Metrics ingestion",
      "description": "Samples appended per second and active series count. Series count is what actually drives Prometheus disk use; a jump here (a new label, a new exporter) is the usual reason its blocks grow.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 21
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(prometheus_tsdb_head_samples_appended_total[5m]))",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "samples/s"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "prometheus_tsdb_head_series",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "active series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Retention, in one place",
      "description": "The configured retention for each signal, and what to check when the disk still fills.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 29
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Retention and caps\n\n| Signal | Kept for | Hard cap | Where it is configured |\n|--------|----------|----------|------------------------|\n| Metrics (Prometheus) | 30 days | 3 GB, whichever comes first | `storage.tsdb.retention` in `prometheus.yml` |\n| Logs (Loki) | 14 days | none (chunk size per stream throttled) | `limits_config.retention_period` in `loki.yml` |\n| Traces (Tempo) | 3 days | none | `backend_scheduler.provider.compaction.compaction.block_retention` in `tempo.yml` |\n| Service logs on disk | rotated at 20 MiB, 7 days | Shepherd log rotation | `log-rotation-service-type` in `config.scm` |\n\nPrometheus and Loki delete the oldest blocks/chunks first, so crossing a cap\ncosts history, never service. If the disk still fills, the usual causes are\n(1) a service writing an unexpected amount of log lines \u2014 see the per-service\nchart above, (2) trace ingestion from a new instrumented app, or (3) rotated\nfiles piling up outside these directories (`du -sh /var/log/* | sort -h`).\n",
        "code": {
          "language": "markdown",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
